{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aren’t sampled again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the tracker has finished. A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"samplingDropReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV19samplingDropReportsScSyAA08SamplingD6ReportVGvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L234","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SamplingDropReport":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport","title":"SamplingDropReport","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/samplingdropreport","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Events a tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s left out: the event’s name, how many were left out and when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they were tracked.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","title":"Trackers","role":"collection","abstract":[]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Records","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"records","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"title":"noOp","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"fra